ary 26) in 1963, but "}, {"cite_id": "W4", "url": "https://www.sydneyoperahouse.com/our-story/jorn-utzon", "title": "Jørn Utzon AC | Sydney Opera House", "domain": "www.sydneyoperahouse.com", "score": 0.6362, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-27T17:39:55.940Z", "snippet": "On 9 April 1956, Danish architect Jørn Utzon AC celebrated his 38th birthday and set to work in his modest office in Hellenbaek, north of Copenhagen, on his designs for the competition. He sent his 12 drawings to Sydney just before the competition closed in December.\n\nJudging beg"}]}}
